{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os' data-target='computer\/os' data-title='OS'>\r\n\t\t\tOS\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os\/nix' data-target='computer\/os\/nix' data-title='*Nix'>\r\n\t\t\t*Nix\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Working notes on SSH: Keys, Reconnect, SSH, and SSH debug.","label":"SSH","prevArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/nix\/sh","label":"Sh","url":"\/computer\/os\/nix\/sh"},"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/nix\/su","label":"su","url":"\/computer\/os\/nix\/su"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<p>\n\t\tWorking notes on SSH: Keys, Reconnect, SSH, and SSH debug.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Topics<\/h2>\n\t<h4>Keys<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tGenerate RSA keys, drop a host from known_hosts, and load a .pem with ssh-add.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Reconnect<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tList and reattach GNU screen sessions with sudo screen -list and -d -r.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>SSH<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tConfigure sshd, place authorized_keys, set permissions, restart the Ubuntu ssh service, and lock down root password login.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>SSH debug<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tTest sshd config, run a parallel debug daemon on another port, and connect with ssh -vvv.\n\t<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<a\r\n\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\